---
// Cancel Page - Payment Cancelled
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Payment Cancelled - ZENO Browser</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem;
      }

      .container {
        background: white;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 3rem;
        max-width: 600px;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      }

      .cancel-icon {
        font-size: 5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        color: #f59e0b;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        color: #6b7280;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 1rem 2rem;
        background: #f59e0b;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: background 0.2s;
        margin: 0.5rem;
      }

      .button:hover {
        background: #d97706;
      }

      .button-secondary {
        background: #6b7280;
      }

      .button-secondary:hover {
        background: #4b5563;
      }

      .reasons {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        text-align: left;
        background: #f9fafb;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }

      .reasons h2 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: #1f2937;
      }

      .reasons ul {
        margin-left: 1.5rem;
        color: #4b5563;
      }

      .reasons li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      .guarantee {
        background: #d1fae5;
        border: 2px solid #10b981;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }

      .guarantee strong {
        color: #059669;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cancel-icon">❌</div>
      <h1>Payment Cancelled</h1>
      <p>
        No worries! Your payment has been cancelled and you haven't been
        charged.
      </p>

      <div class="guarantee">
        <strong>💚 14-Day Money-Back Guarantee</strong>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 0.875rem;">
          Try ZENO Browser Pro risk-free. Not satisfied? Get a full refund
          within 14 days.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reasons">
        <h2>🤔 Why Developers Choose ZENO Browser</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Unlimited Testing:</strong> No restrictions on iframe tests
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Advanced Analytics:</strong> Track performance and errors in
            real-time
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>API Access:</strong> Integrate with your existing tools
          </li>
          <li><strong>Priority Support:</strong> Get help when you need it</li>
          <li><strong>Regular Updates:</strong> New features added monthly</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a href="/pricing" class="button">Try Again</a>
        <a href="/" class="button button-secondary">Go Home</a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: #9ca3af;">
        Questions? <a href="/support" style="color: #f59e0b;">Chat with us</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
